{"name":"Badge","description":"Add a count or compact status next to another object · A badge sits beside an icon, tab, or avatar to show a count, short label, or status dot, such as unread messages. Important meaning cannot rely on color alone, and screen readers need a complete description rather than just a number or dot.","quote":"Show a little red number on the message icon for how many messages are unread.","agentPrompt":"Add an unread-count badge to the message entry and expose Messages, 3 unread to assistive technology. Hide the badge at zero, show 99+ above the cap, and verify count changes do not shift the navigation layout.","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-badge\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>Badge</h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">You might say</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">Show a little red number on the message icon for how many messages are unread.</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">Add a count or compact status next to another object</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>A badge sits beside an icon, tab, or avatar to show a count, short label, or status dot, such as unread messages. Important meaning cannot rely on color alone, and screen readers need a complete description rather than just a number or dot.</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><span class=\"badge-d\"><span class=\"icon-btn\">🔔</span><span class=\"b-num\">5</span></span>\n  <span class=\"badge-d\"><span class=\"icon-btn\">✉️</span><span class=\"b-num\">99+</span></span>\n  <span class=\"badge-d\"><span class=\"avatar-d\" style=\"background:#165dff\">Lin</span><span class=\"b-status\"></span></span></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\