/span><span style=\"position:absolute;top:-6px;right:-8px;min-width:16px;height:16px;padding:0 4px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--red);color:var(--on-status);font-size:12px;line-height:16px;text-align:center;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #fff\">9</span></span><span style=\"position:relative;display:inline-flex\"><span class=\"mk-icon-btn\">⚙</span><span style=\"position:absolute;top:-6px;right:-8px;min-width:16px;height:16px;padding:0 4px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--red);color:var(--on-status);font-size:12px;line-height:16px;text-align:center;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #fff\">2</span></span><span style=\"position:relative;display:inline-flex\"><span class=\"mk-icon-btn\">★</span><span style=\"position:absolute;top:-6px;right:-8px;min-width:16px;height:16px;padding:0 4px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--red);color:var(--on-status);font-size:12px;line-height:16px;text-align:center;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #fff\">7</span></span><span style=\"position:relative;display:inline-flex\"><span class=\"mk-icon-btn\">☰</span><span style=\"position:absolute;top:-6px;right:-8px;min-width:16px;height:16px;padding:0 4px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--red);color:var(--on-status);font-size:12px;line-height:16px;text-align:center;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #fff\">4</span></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);line-height:1.5\">If every item has a red dot, nothing stands out as needing attention</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Attach several badges to the same small target</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-scene \"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div><div class=\"mk-notif\"><b>Review declined</b><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:95%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i>\n        <span class=\"mk-link\" style=\"font-size:12px\">V